# Used only when building Dockerfile.worker (BuildKit picks "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" before .dockerignore).
# The worker image needs requirements-worker.txt, src/shared and src/ingestion, and nothing else, so everything else
# stays out of the build context: it is smaller and faster to send, and a change in the app or the data never
# invalidates a worker build.
*
!requirements-worker.txt
!src/shared/
!src/ingestion/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
